---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['dorchester-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Dorchester County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Dorchester County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Experienced Legal Representation in Dorchester County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Dorchester County, the largest county on Maryland's Eastern Shore by land area, encompasses 
    the historic city of Cambridge and vast stretches of marshland and waterways. From the 
    Blackwater National Wildlife Refuge to the working waterfronts, residents face unique 
    challenges that require experienced legal representation. Attorney Alex Poberesky serves 
    Dorchester County clients with dedication.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Dorchester County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Dorchester County's economy relies heavily on seafood, agriculture, and tourism, each 
    bringing its own workplace hazards. Whether you've been injured on a commercial fishing 
    vessel, hurt in a car accident on Route 50 or Route 16, or suffered harm due to someone 
    else's negligence, we can help you seek compensation.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle personal injury cases throughout Dorchester County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car and truck accidents on Routes 50 and 16</li>
    <li>Commercial fishing and maritime injuries</li>
    <li>Boating accidents</li>
    <li>Agricultural and farming accidents</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at UM Shore Medical Center at Dorchester</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries in seafood processing facilities</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Dorchester County</h3>
  
  <p>
    If you've been charged with a crime in Dorchester County, you need an attorney who will 
    fight for your rights. We defend clients against DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, 
    theft, and other criminal matters in the Dorchester County courts.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Committed to Eastern Shore Clients</h3>
  
  <p>
    While our office is in Pikesville, we understand that Dorchester County residents deserve 
    access to experienced legal representation. We travel to Cambridge and throughout the 
    county to meet with clients and appear in court. Our 26+ years of experience ensures 
    quality representation.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Dorchester County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Dorchester County, including Cambridge, Hurlock, 
    East New Market, Secretary, Vienna, Federalsburg, and surrounding areas. Contact us 
    today for a free consultation.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
